			<td>
			<p><strong><span class="txt_big"><span class="txt_small">ごみ重量10kgまでごとに200円<span class="txt_red">＋</span></span></span></strong><span class="txt_small"><span class="txt_big"><span class="txt_red"><strong>スプリングマットレス1個あたり3,000円</strong></span></span></span></p>
